{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T04:50:48.635Z","ordinal":37873,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a10e2a-6616-7a42-8b17-50e4af22487f","item":{"type":"Extension","kind":"web.search","id":"exec-cf632eab-cae9-4806-996b-a7e4e38e84af","query":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/reference/http-headers/","action":{"type":"openPage","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/reference/http-headers/"},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.cloudflare.com","ref_id":"turn22view0","snippet":"Total lines: 417","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/REDACTED","title":"Cloudflare HTTP headers · Cloudflare Fundamentals docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/reference/http-headers/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"developers.cloudflare.com","ref_id":"turn22view1","snippet":"Total lines: 1072","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/REDACTED","title":"Request · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/request/"}]},"started_at_ms":1791262245070,"completed_at_ms":1791262248635}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T04:50:48.689Z","ordinal":37874,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a10f8c-cef1-7ef2-bb9f-609473aa704d","call_id":"call_9XfdAA22lmGwXmDwb07LM5Sy","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Cloudflare HTTP headers · Cloudflare Fundamentals docs (https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/reference/http-headers/)\nciteturn22view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/reference/http-headers/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 417\nL0: cite0†Skip to content L1: \nL2: > Documentation Index\nL3: > Fetch the complete documentation index at: https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/llms.txt\nL4: > Use this file to discover all available pages before exploring further.\nL5: \nL6: Search`Ctrl``K`\nL7: \nL8: cite1†Cloudflare Fundamentals L9: \nL10: [Input: Filter sidebar]`/`\nL11: \nL12:   * cite1†Overview L13:   * Concepts\nL14: \nL15:     * cite2†How Cloudflare DNS works L16:     * cite3†Traffic flow through Cloudflare L17:     * cite4†Accounts, zones, and profiles L18:     * cite5†Cloudflare IP addresses L19: \nL20:   * cite6†Get started L21:   * Accounts\nL22:     * cite7†Create account L23:     * Account security\nL24: \nL25:       * cite8†Add abuse contact L26:       * cite9†Allow Cloudflare access L27:       * cite10†Leaked Password Notifications L28:       * cite11†Manage active sessions L29:       * cite12†Review audit logs - v1 L30:       * cite13†Audit Logs - v2 L31:       * SCIM provisioning\nL32: \nL33:         * cite14†Overview L34:         * cite15†Authentik L35:         * cite16†Microsoft Entra L36:         * cite17†Okta L37:         * cite18†Troubleshooting L38: \nL39:       * cite19†Secure compromised account L40:       * cite20†Set up SSO ↗︎ L41:  