{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T04:51:52.106Z","ordinal":37894,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac47e5eb43c87d08521d2dbf24dc77a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_dZpWHlLItSb87BePebpKZ3gT","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('/private/tmp/dev75-rate-implementation-outline.md');s=p.read_text();s+='\\\\nFurther ingress review, 2026-10-06: the Rules-language cf.worker.upstream_zone field is not documented as Request.cf. Do not invent that runtime property. Cloudflare documents CF-Worker on fetch subrequests and mutable x-real-ip in same-zone subrequests. A direct-edge key decoder should reject detected forwarded Worker identity rather than silently trusting its IP; the website uses the binding-only operation for its checked original identity. Explicitly qualify missing/invalid/forwarded identity and metadata independence, and document unsupported identity forwarding. Production header guarantees and configured account/zone/namespace still need independent readback before apply.\\\\n\\\\nNamespace intent: use a checked required per-stage CALCULATOR_RATE_NAMESPACE configuration rather than a guessed Production integer or collision-prone hash. Local fixture 10075 stays preparation-only. Planning/fixtures must supply explicit isolated values, and operation documentation must require account-wide uniqueness readback before final provider-plan approval. Native RateLimit has no separately created backing cloud resource.\\\\n\\\\nCurrent owners read: apps/api worker/application, packages/calculators work/service/schemas, HTTP group/handlers, RPC expected and client errors/handlers, Website server/config/private transport, infrastructure apps stack. Direct engine/local SDK preserve existing operation; rate wraps only hosted shared calculate continuation inside its existing five-second budget. Runtime Client construction must keep request Context across generated RPC batching.\\\\n\\\\nSources: https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/reference/http-headers/ ; https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/request/ ; https://developers.cloudflare.com/waf/custom-rules/use-cases/block-worker-subrequests/ ; installed Alchemy 2.0.0-beta.80 RateLimit.ts and WorkerBridge/Rpc. Preparation remains open; no tracked binding or provider mutation.\\\\n';p.write_text(s)\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:300}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"tail -8 tmp/release-readiness/verification-stdout-kPT3Pm/26ad69dacb87.log\",max_output_tokens:700}));\ntext(await tools.clock__curr_time({}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10e2a-6616-7a42-8b17-50e4af22487f","create_time":1791262283.991765}}}
